      "url": "https://iep.utm.edu/byz-phil/",
      "noteZh": "IEP Byzantine Philosophy 总论用于核验希腊教父与拜占庭/东正教思想连续性。"
    },
    {
      "label": "S002",
      "url": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Saint-Basil-the-Great",
      "noteZh": "Britannica Basil 条目用于核验其生卒、卡帕多西亚教父身份和修道/神学位置。"
    },
